  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation in Analytics, Technology and Partnerships to Eliminate Slavery in Thai Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Issara Institute will work to decrease the incidence of trafficking by promoting cleaner supply chains and safer work places. This will be accomplished by increasing private-sector partnerships and through awareness raising efforts. Specifically, the Issara Institute will expand its anti-trafficking hotline and continue the development of a Burmese-language smartphone app for migrant laborers in Thailand. In collaboration with private sector companies, Issara Institute will use the data from their hotline and app to improve supply chain tractability and risk identification for private sector companies.</narrative>
  </description>
